WEBVTT

00:01.918 --> 00:05.755
<i>With over thirty million</i>
<i>players worldwide,</i>

00:05.839 --> 00:08.842
<i>it reigns supreme over</i>
<i>all Full-Dive VR games.</i>

00:08.925 --> 00:12.554
<i>In Shangri-La Frontier,</i>
<i>known as a god-tier game,</i>

00:13.638 --> 00:18.435
<i>there exist Unique Monsters</i>
<i>called "The Seven Colossi."</i>

00:19.686 --> 00:24.566
<i>One of them is Lycagon the Nightslayer.</i>

00:25.400 --> 00:28.069
I'm nothing like the last time!

00:29.070 --> 00:33.742
I'll show you the power
of a level-99 player!

00:44.794 --> 00:46.087
<i>What you wanna be?</i>

00:50.049 --> 00:51.634
<i>We are the frontiers</i>

00:55.096 --> 00:56.806
<i>Confront with no fear</i>

00:56.890 --> 00:58.975
<i>From zero to a hundred in an instant</i>

00:59.059 --> 01:01.644
<i>Unveiling mysteries hidden</i>
<i>deep in the dark</i>

01:02.228 --> 01:04.105
<i>Even dead, I rise from the dust</i>

01:04.189 --> 01:06.733
<i>Reaching an unprecedented realm</i>

01:06.816 --> 01:09.027
<i>Trying your uniqueness</i>

01:09.110 --> 01:10.278
<i>It's a test level EX</i>

01:10.361 --> 01:11.905
<i>I'm the best, nothing less</i>

01:11.988 --> 01:14.240
<i>Pioneering from the east to the west</i>

01:14.324 --> 01:16.910
<i>Erasing all who resist, their data and all</i>

01:16.993 --> 01:18.203
<i>Did I really win?</i>

01:18.286 --> 01:19.496
<i>What are these tears?</i>

01:19.579 --> 01:21.956
<i>Who will be hated or loved</i>
<i>by the god of victory?</i>

01:22.040 --> 01:23.208
<i>To Each, their own wishes</i>

01:23.291 --> 01:24.292
<i>With friends, aiming for prize</i>

01:24.375 --> 01:26.294
<i>Seeking answers,</i>
<i>cutting through the unknown</i>

01:26.377 --> 01:27.587
<i>What you wanna be?</i>

01:27.670 --> 01:30.048
<i>Bugged out world, I'm a survivor</i>

01:30.131 --> 01:32.383
<i>Blazing with the guiding fire</i>

01:32.467 --> 01:34.260
<i>Show me the Show me the Shangri-La</i>

01:34.344 --> 01:35.178
<i>What you wanna be?</i>

01:35.261 --> 01:36.846
<i>Show me the Show me the Shangri-La</i>

01:36.930 --> 01:37.764
<i>What you wanna be?</i>

01:37.847 --> 01:40.683
<i>Declare war. At the system, we aim back</i>

01:40.767 --> 01:43.061
<i>Lose yourself, and it's game over</i>

01:43.144 --> 01:44.979
<i>Show me the Show me the Shangri-La</i>

01:45.063 --> 01:45.897
<i>What you wanna be?</i>

01:45.980 --> 01:47.315
<i>Show me the Show me the Shangri-La</i>

01:47.398 --> 01:48.691
<i>What you wanna be?</i>

01:52.695 --> 01:54.114
<i>We are the frontiers</i>

01:57.826 --> 01:59.327
<i>Confront with no fear</i>

02:00.245 --> 02:01.454
<i>You know I'll be there</i>

02:01.538 --> 02:02.705
<i>Overturning limits</i>

02:02.789 --> 02:04.499
<i>Now is the new beginning</i>

02:08.753 --> 02:11.673
Whoa! Please, listen to me!

02:11.756 --> 02:14.926
I was hoping you could wait over
at the Palace of Rabituza!

02:15.009 --> 02:16.344
That's all right!

02:16.427 --> 02:18.304
It's faster to run, after all!

02:18.388 --> 02:19.264
I think!

02:21.641 --> 02:24.519
Best to give it up, my sister.

02:24.602 --> 02:27.564
It is simply in this girl's nature.

02:27.647 --> 02:31.776
But art thou quite sure that this
man is an acquaintance of thy?

02:32.527 --> 02:34.279
I'm not certain.

02:35.029 --> 02:36.030
But…

02:36.698 --> 02:39.367
Based on what Emul-san told me…

02:39.450 --> 02:41.452
It's the same Sunraku-san!

02:42.162 --> 02:43.329
I'm sure of it!

02:46.040 --> 02:49.085
<i>That there was no way we could</i>
<i>put on a fight against Lycagon.</i>

02:49.627 --> 02:51.838
<i>But Hizutome-kun…</i>

02:51.921 --> 02:54.132
<i>No matter who we face,</i>
<i>if I'm fighting alongside you…</i>

02:55.133 --> 02:56.676
<i>…I don't feel we can lose!</i>

02:58.052 --> 02:59.429
Apocalypse!

03:08.813 --> 03:10.231
Rei!

03:15.236 --> 03:21.242
(Embracing Your Ambitions In The Light
Part 3)

03:22.201 --> 03:26.372
<i>Even though I've seen Hizutome-kun's</i>
<i>maneuvers to deal with her attacks…</i>

03:26.456 --> 03:28.249
<i>I couldn't pull it off!</i>

03:29.000 --> 03:31.169
Rei, heal up!

03:31.252 --> 03:33.963
<i>It's all right! They got</i>
<i>blown a fair distance away!</i>

03:35.548 --> 03:39.260
<i>If I keep attacking,</i>
<i>she should be targeting me instead!</i>

03:40.970 --> 03:42.764
C'mon, what's wrong?!

03:47.727 --> 03:50.230
<i>She's completely ignoring me!</i>

03:57.904 --> 03:59.739
<i>I have no chance to heal!</i>

03:59.822 --> 04:02.408
<i>My sword feels heavier than usual!</i>

04:02.492 --> 04:03.826
<i>My armor too!</i>

04:08.539 --> 04:10.333
<i>My body feels heavy…</i>

04:10.416 --> 04:15.463
<i>If I'm defeated here, we'll lose</i>
<i>all our offense against Lycagon!</i>

04:18.174 --> 04:20.260
Rei!

04:20.343 --> 04:22.887
Rei!

04:24.973 --> 04:25.890
<i>No!</i>

04:26.432 --> 04:29.978
<i>He would not give up just</i>
<i>from something like this!</i>

04:30.812 --> 04:34.565
<i>And I'm among the top players!</i>
<i>An Attack Master!</i>

04:35.483 --> 04:38.987
<i>It'll be rude to Hizutome-kun</i>
<i>if I whine about this!</i>

04:44.492 --> 04:45.994
<i>My body?!</i>

04:57.005 --> 04:58.506
<i>Her clone!</i>

04:59.799 --> 05:03.636
<i>In the end, I'm only dragging him down…</i>

05:06.472 --> 05:07.807
Rei!

05:22.613 --> 05:23.614
Huh?

05:23.698 --> 05:24.907
A log?

05:24.991 --> 05:28.578
Hagakushi Secret Arts, Utsusemi!

05:31.122 --> 05:34.792
When it comes to body replacement
technique, a log is given!

05:34.876 --> 05:38.379
Thanks to you standing in place,
I managed to make it in time!

05:40.131 --> 05:41.632
<i>I'm alive…</i>

05:41.716 --> 05:44.135
<i>No, she saved me?</i>

05:44.761 --> 05:47.388
<i>Who is this ninja person?</i>

05:48.514 --> 05:50.308
Th-Thanks.

05:50.391 --> 05:51.851
No biggies.

05:51.934 --> 05:57.440
Sorry for the abrupt question,
but you're not Sunraku-san, right?

05:58.316 --> 06:00.318
No, I'm Psyger-0.

06:00.401 --> 06:04.405
I knew it! Then that person
over there must be Sunraku-san!

06:05.531 --> 06:10.703
I heard he was a bird-head with a getup
that makes you question his sanity,

06:10.787 --> 06:13.331
but he looks sturdier than
I imagined, so I had to ask.

06:14.040 --> 06:16.876
<i>Is she one of Hizutome-kun's friends?</i>

06:17.835 --> 06:20.671
Wh-Who's that?

06:20.755 --> 06:23.341
A player, right?

06:25.134 --> 06:27.637
Sunraku-san!

06:29.138 --> 06:30.556
What?! A new monster?!

06:30.640 --> 06:31.891
Wait, Emul!

06:31.974 --> 06:34.477
We finally meet again!

06:34.560 --> 06:36.479
It was such a long journey!

06:36.562 --> 06:38.606
What are you doing here?

06:38.689 --> 06:40.691
I told you to wait in the palace!

06:40.775 --> 06:43.861
We had a lot of stuff going
on our end, too, okay!

06:46.447 --> 06:50.326
Well, well. We've finally caught up.

06:51.994 --> 06:53.454
Another rabbit?

06:53.538 --> 06:57.041
I don't think I need to ask,
but are you Emul's brother?

06:57.125 --> 07:01.212
Indeed. I thank thee for
taking care of my sister.

07:01.295 --> 07:04.882
He's Ceecrue-oniichan.
The one I talked about before.

07:04.966 --> 07:06.551
(Ceecrue)

07:06.634 --> 07:12.432
Milady Akitsuakane over there
insisted on meeting thee.

07:12.515 --> 07:14.434
So I am here accompanying her.

07:14.976 --> 07:17.311
Hm? Akitsuakane?

07:17.395 --> 07:18.938
That rings a bell…

07:19.647 --> 07:20.606
Wait, what?!

07:20.690 --> 07:25.695
So that means she's that player
who came to Rabituza Palace?!

07:36.706 --> 07:40.084
That's a really big… doggy?

07:40.168 --> 07:45.506
U-Um, thank you for saving me earlier.

07:45.590 --> 07:46.924
Don't mind it!

07:47.675 --> 07:50.178
By the way, um…

07:50.261 --> 07:55.433
May I ask what kind of relationship
you have with Sunraku-san?

07:56.184 --> 07:57.310
Um…

07:58.978 --> 08:00.897
Well…

08:00.980 --> 08:04.150
He's like a "Senpai"
I respect a lot, I suppose?

08:04.817 --> 08:06.736
Senpai?

08:07.862 --> 08:09.280
Watch out!

08:09.363 --> 08:11.449
Hagakushi Secret Arts!

08:12.116 --> 08:13.159
Utsusemi!

08:17.622 --> 08:19.707
That was close!

08:19.790 --> 08:22.710
<i>Utsusemi is a hard skill to time,</i>
<i>but she pulled it off twice.</i>

08:22.793 --> 08:25.213
<i>She's good.</i>

08:25.796 --> 08:27.590
Akitsuakane…

08:27.673 --> 08:31.761
Not only with Rabituza, but she's
getting involved with Lycagon, too?

08:31.844 --> 08:34.263
Still, although defending
was all she could do,

08:34.347 --> 08:37.475
she did well holding
out against Lycagon.

08:37.558 --> 08:38.559
Despite her appearances,

08:38.643 --> 08:41.854
she's a skilled fighter who's been
recognized by one of the Seven Colossi,

08:41.938 --> 08:45.983
"The Golden Dragon King"
Siegwurm the Sky Ruler.

08:46.859 --> 08:49.237
Oh right, Emul did say
something like that.

08:50.530 --> 08:53.282
<i>That scar on her face…</i>
<i>Is that a mark?</i>

08:53.366 --> 08:56.118
<i>That means she's been cursed by Siegwurm.</i>

08:57.119 --> 08:59.372
We're saved thanks to her help,

08:59.455 --> 09:02.375
but what business does she have with me?

09:02.458 --> 09:05.878
<i>It's great that she's willing</i>
<i>to help in this dire situation,</i>

09:06.671 --> 09:11.217
<i>but she's the only player who has info</i>
<i>on the Unique Scenario I had monopoly on.</i>

09:11.300 --> 09:13.302
<i>What is she after?</i>

09:15.054 --> 09:16.556
C'mon, dude!

09:16.639 --> 09:18.808
Why am I thinking about
boring stuff like that again?

09:18.891 --> 09:20.101
What?!

09:20.184 --> 09:23.771
<i>Now's not the time to</i>
<i>worry about that, Sunraku!</i>

09:25.273 --> 09:27.275
Akitsuakane!

09:28.359 --> 09:30.861
Can you keep backing up
Rei like you're doing right now?

09:30.945 --> 09:33.864
I'm sorry for the sudden request,
but you're the only one I can count on!

09:37.034 --> 09:39.287
(Sunraku sent you a party invite. Accept?)
(No) (Yes)

09:39.870 --> 09:42.623
Roger that! I'm on the job!

09:42.707 --> 09:44.875
(Party Members: Sunraku, Emul
Psyger-0, Ceecrue, Akitsuakane)

09:44.959 --> 09:45.793
Oh.

09:46.627 --> 09:50.298
<i>Sh-She's a reliable helper, and yet…</i>

09:50.381 --> 09:52.967
<i>I can't help but feel like</i>
<i>I'm losing at something!</i>

09:58.222 --> 10:01.767
I see. I understand the
situation now, more or less.

10:01.851 --> 10:05.896
She sure is focusing her attacks
entirely on you, Psyger-0-san.

10:06.480 --> 10:09.442
I have to find an outlet to attack!

10:14.822 --> 10:19.493
I wouldst never have imagined you'd
be fighting the Night Emperor herself.

10:19.577 --> 10:22.663
You just never know what
Sunraku-san will get up to!

10:22.747 --> 10:25.833
I'm just as surprised by it as you are.

10:26.500 --> 10:30.755
Anyway, our current problem
is that she's targeting Rei.

10:30.838 --> 10:33.758
Perhaps she thinks they're
the most dangerous foe,

10:33.841 --> 10:37.261
or maybe she's figured out our plan.

10:37.345 --> 10:39.013
Plan?

10:39.096 --> 10:42.975
Either way, we've got to divert
Lycagon's focus away from Rei.

10:43.059 --> 10:45.353
Otherwise, we'll have
no chance of winning this!

10:45.436 --> 10:46.270
Mhm.

10:46.354 --> 10:49.440
Ceecrue! Lend those two your hand!

10:49.523 --> 10:51.108
Very well!

10:52.943 --> 10:55.488
Okay! Let us go, Emul!

10:55.571 --> 10:57.031
Yessir!

11:01.869 --> 11:05.164
So what should we do?

11:05.247 --> 11:06.666
Let's see…

11:06.749 --> 11:09.960
How about we try stopping her
from moving with Magic Chain?

11:10.044 --> 11:12.463
Yessir! I'll try!

11:15.132 --> 11:16.258
Emul!

11:16.342 --> 11:18.594
Magic Chain!

11:25.184 --> 11:27.144
Good job, Emul! You got her!

11:29.814 --> 11:33.234
It's no good! She broke
my chain in an instant!

11:33.317 --> 11:35.820
That brief distraction is all I wanted!

11:36.695 --> 11:38.823
Skill! Unbroken Light-dance!

11:38.906 --> 11:40.825
(Unbroken Light-dance)

11:44.412 --> 11:47.164
Tch, ignoring me again?

11:47.248 --> 11:49.917
So an attack like that wasn't
even worth paying attention to, eh?!

11:51.252 --> 11:53.838
But that was a cool skill!

11:53.921 --> 11:58.300
It's like the Quick-Draw Fist
you used in <i>Berserk Online Passion</i>!

11:58.384 --> 12:02.680
Hey, there! Could you please not compare
it to a bugged move from a trash ga-

12:04.014 --> 12:06.559
<i>Berserk Online Passion</i>?

12:07.935 --> 12:11.272
Wait, are you a <i>BERP</i> player?

12:14.442 --> 12:18.612
Yes! There, I went with
the name Dragonfly.

12:18.696 --> 12:21.615
We fought once before!

12:21.699 --> 12:23.451
Dragonfly…

12:24.368 --> 12:27.746
Oooh! That player who
discovered that new bug?!

12:28.289 --> 12:29.623
Yes!

12:30.541 --> 12:31.959
Eh?

12:32.042 --> 12:36.547
Did you come all the way here just because
you thought I was the same"Sunraku"?

12:36.630 --> 12:39.633
I enlisted the help of
Emul-san and Ceecrue-san,

12:39.717 --> 12:43.220
and traversed three areas
to reach here from Thirdrema!

12:43.304 --> 12:47.475
Ah, oooh, hmm…

12:47.558 --> 12:51.479
<i>Maybe she's as dangerous as Katzo</i>
<i>or Pencilgon, but on a different spectrum?</i>

12:55.316 --> 12:58.319
So that's what she meant by "Senpai."

12:59.487 --> 13:02.656
Satanael! Inverse, Satan!

13:04.575 --> 13:08.954
<i>That means I still have a decent chance!</i>

13:12.833 --> 13:14.627
Catastrophe!

13:20.174 --> 13:23.761
<i>Good! Now I just have to land</i>
<i>two more Apocalypse.</i>

13:23.844 --> 13:28.432
<i>And if I can land one more Catastrophe,</i>
<i>I'll fulfill the requireme-</i>

13:32.478 --> 13:34.063
Another clone?!

13:34.146 --> 13:36.982
Hagakushi Secret Arts, Utsusemi!

13:42.988 --> 13:45.282
I'm sorry. I let my guard down.

13:45.824 --> 13:47.993
So that's the clone attack?

13:48.077 --> 13:51.539
It must be hard to dodge
when you get ambushed like that.

13:59.588 --> 14:03.259
Who would've thought my connections
from another game would lead to this.

14:04.552 --> 14:08.514
<i>But she's not the "muscle-head"</i>
<i>she was back then…</i>

14:10.349 --> 14:13.352
<i>This time she's more of the athletic type.</i>

14:15.104 --> 14:19.191
<i>She must be the type to set a goal</i>
<i>to improve her performance.</i>

14:20.276 --> 14:24.029
But still, that body replacement
move really helps out!

14:24.113 --> 14:25.698
Even if I use my Mirror of Fading,

14:25.781 --> 14:30.536
it'd be hard to pull her in
when she's not focused on me.

14:30.619 --> 14:32.788
Um, about that!

14:32.872 --> 14:37.418
To use Utsusemi, I need to use
a consumable item called a decoy log.

14:37.501 --> 14:41.297
And I used up my last log just now!

14:41.380 --> 14:42.631
What?!

14:43.799 --> 14:47.928
Given, as we weren't prepared to
face the Night Emperor to begin with.

14:56.186 --> 14:57.438
Akane-dono!

15:06.030 --> 15:07.907
That was quite a close call.

15:07.990 --> 15:09.867
Thank you, Ceecrue-san!

15:11.285 --> 15:15.956
Sunraku-san!
Sorry, but I'm still level 43!

15:16.040 --> 15:19.585
I don't think I can help much
on the damage front.

15:19.668 --> 15:22.463
Got it! Don't force yourself!

15:23.130 --> 15:26.425
<i>We can't use any more decoys,</i>
<i>which means…</i>

15:27.801 --> 15:30.971
I've got to direct her focus towards me.

15:31.055 --> 15:33.057
But how do you do that?

15:35.559 --> 15:39.146
No, I've got to confirm something
first before using <i>this</i>.

15:39.229 --> 15:40.230
Huh?

15:40.773 --> 15:46.654
<i>One of the Seven Colossi, equipped with</i>
<i>not only strong, but smart AI…</i>

15:46.737 --> 15:48.781
<i>Lycagon the Nightslayer.</i>

15:50.282 --> 15:54.495
<i>But there's something odd</i>
<i>about her unrelated to that.</i>

15:56.038 --> 16:01.377
<i>This game portrays the blood splashing</i>
<i>out of a monster with polygon effects.</i>

16:02.586 --> 16:04.797
<i>But throughout the battle so far…</i>

16:04.880 --> 16:07.383
<i>She never once gave off</i>
<i>such polygon effects.</i>

16:08.217 --> 16:12.137
<i>At first I thought she's simply that tough</i>
<i>and my attacks weren't reaching her.</i>

16:12.680 --> 16:17.559
<i>But the same goes even when she was hit with</i>
<i>Rei's attacks that clearly impacted her.</i>

16:19.103 --> 16:20.980
<i>That means Lycagon is…</i>

16:21.647 --> 16:22.648
Emul!

16:22.731 --> 16:23.649
Yessir?

16:23.732 --> 16:25.651
You've got that spell
called "Mana Shaker," right?

16:25.734 --> 16:27.736
Hit her with that!

16:27.820 --> 16:28.821
Yessir!

16:28.904 --> 16:30.823
Huh? But that spell is…

16:30.906 --> 16:32.533
It's fine!

16:32.616 --> 16:35.327
It's just a theory, but I think
it'll have an effect on her.

16:35.411 --> 16:38.747
C'mon! We've got no time to dwell on it!

16:38.831 --> 16:40.165
I understand!

16:40.249 --> 16:41.583
Add Spell!

16:42.918 --> 16:45.004
Mana Shaker!

16:56.056 --> 16:57.975
It only grazed her!

16:58.058 --> 17:00.102
No, it's bingo!

17:00.185 --> 17:03.230
It wasn't much, but you
inflicted damage on her!

17:03.313 --> 17:07.026
Mana Shaker has no effect
on physical targets…

17:07.693 --> 17:11.030
But it has a huge effect on monsters
whose body is made out of magic,

17:11.113 --> 17:17.786
such as non-physical enemies like ghosts!

17:19.538 --> 17:20.914
And…

17:20.998 --> 17:25.419
That's what you are,
Lycagon the Nightslayer!

17:26.754 --> 17:28.839
It was obvious once you think about it.

17:28.922 --> 17:33.427
Not just the clone, but the main
one can traverse the shadow.

17:33.510 --> 17:37.514
That means you're built the same way
as the clones born from the darkness!

17:38.223 --> 17:39.558
I see.

17:39.641 --> 17:42.603
So a damage of that level
won't even leave a wound, huh?

17:43.145 --> 17:48.275
Seems like you've been secretly repairing
the damage Rei dealt to you, too.

17:53.864 --> 17:55.199
Great job, Emul!

17:55.282 --> 17:58.285
Now she's decided that
you're one dangerous bunny!

18:01.705 --> 18:05.542
I wanna go home!

18:06.335 --> 18:07.669
She changed her target!

18:08.504 --> 18:09.797
I'll launch an attack!

18:09.880 --> 18:11.799
- Roger!
- I will provide thee assistance!

18:13.801 --> 18:15.677
It went well for now!

18:15.761 --> 18:17.888
She's chasing after me!

18:17.971 --> 18:20.974
Hahahaha! She's got all her eyes on you!

18:21.058 --> 18:24.561
This is not a laughing matter!

18:24.645 --> 18:28.649
True. Looks like I can't just
laugh it off any longer.

18:30.776 --> 18:34.696
<i>Having her target Emul is pretty risky.</i>

18:35.697 --> 18:41.203
<i>Because unlike players, NPC won't</i>
<i>respawn once they get killed.</i>

18:41.870 --> 18:46.416
<i>If I flee into Inventoria</i>
<i>because I can't dodge an attack,</i>

18:46.500 --> 18:49.336
<i>I might be safe, but the same</i>
<i>can't be said for Emul.</i>

18:52.631 --> 18:54.883
<i>And of course,</i>
<i>I won't let myself lose here.</i>

18:56.135 --> 18:56.969
Emul.

18:58.053 --> 19:00.889
Now that you guys are here,
I've made up my mind.

19:02.391 --> 19:06.478
When there's more trouble to deal with,
gamers will sharpen their performance.

19:07.980 --> 19:09.648
Don't worry, Emul.

19:09.731 --> 19:11.733
I'll warp this up right away.

19:12.317 --> 19:14.236
Let me tell you, Lycagon!

19:14.319 --> 19:18.657
Rei's not the only one here
who's got a card up their sleeve!

19:20.492 --> 19:22.578
Huh? Wh-What?!

19:22.661 --> 19:25.914
Suzaku only has
five percent of energy left?!

19:25.998 --> 19:29.042
Just clearing the cloud
eats that much energy!?

19:29.126 --> 19:31.670
It won't last a minute at this rate!

19:31.753 --> 19:34.673
Suzaku! Cut your boosters
and dive down!

19:34.756 --> 19:37.176
Standby with as little power as possible!

19:37.259 --> 19:38.343
Roger.

19:41.930 --> 19:44.683
<i>Suzaku's still got one</i>
<i>more important job left.</i>

19:44.766 --> 19:47.186
<i>I can't let it run out of gas now!</i>

19:47.269 --> 19:51.356
Wh-What are you saying?
Who are you talking to?!

19:51.440 --> 19:54.109
Now it's a battle against time!

19:54.193 --> 19:56.278
I'm counting on you, Rei!

20:01.742 --> 20:03.285
Catastrophe!

20:04.077 --> 20:07.080
(Catastrophe)

20:07.748 --> 20:09.917
Now just one more to go!

20:11.084 --> 20:12.419
Inverse!

20:16.131 --> 20:18.008
Fall back, Psyger-0-dono!

20:18.967 --> 20:21.136
Thou art being targeted again!

20:21.220 --> 20:23.138
Emul! Get Mana Shaker ready!

20:23.222 --> 20:25.224
Pull her focus back to us!

20:25.307 --> 20:28.685
I only just used it,
so I can't fire it yet!

20:29.311 --> 20:31.480
Prepare Magic Chain, then!

20:31.563 --> 20:32.606
Yessir!

20:32.689 --> 20:34.441
Firing-up!

20:46.787 --> 20:47.913
You're wide open!

20:49.039 --> 20:51.124
Apocalypse!

20:59.007 --> 21:00.300
She dodged it?!

21:00.884 --> 21:02.094
No.

21:02.177 --> 21:04.429
It hit her.

21:07.349 --> 21:09.893
The requirements were fulfilled.

21:11.019 --> 21:14.189
Hitting her in that tiny window
of opening. Great job, Rei!

21:15.232 --> 21:17.859
Just leave the rest to us
and start casting your skill.

21:17.943 --> 21:18.902
Right!

21:23.490 --> 21:26.618
<i>I am the harnesser of chaos.</i>

21:28.453 --> 21:29.955
What an incredible battle.

21:31.206 --> 21:33.375
What should we do?

21:33.458 --> 21:36.962
'Tis not the time for us to take action.

21:38.755 --> 21:42.551
Rei's ultimate requires
a long chant to cast.

21:42.634 --> 21:45.595
They will be defenseless
during that, of course.

21:45.679 --> 21:48.056
I gotta protect them at all costs!

21:49.474 --> 21:52.352
Now's time for the climax!

21:52.436 --> 21:55.731
Come at me, you mutt!

22:31.683 --> 22:33.935
I hide in my brain every day

22:34.019 --> 22:35.896
cause I'm running out of patience

22:36.563 --> 22:38.356
lost in distorted thoughts

22:38.440 --> 22:42.444
I can't help but hold my breath

22:42.527 --> 22:44.529
blurred mind, spinning in place

22:44.613 --> 22:46.740
I long to turn away from that scene
to close my eyes.

22:46.823 --> 22:47.991
I don't like what I'm seeing

22:48.075 --> 22:48.909
and it's a curse

22:48.992 --> 22:51.161
it's a thorn in my side

22:52.621 --> 22:54.623
Countless eyes and voices

22:54.706 --> 23:01.421
clapping and laughing,
with a nihilistic air

23:01.505 --> 23:03.590
I'm losing my mind

23:03.673 --> 23:06.134
Inside this scary little world

23:06.218 --> 23:11.014
life is gradually soaking up my dopamine

23:11.098 --> 23:12.474
but I can breathe

23:12.557 --> 23:14.101
I can feel like I matter

23:14.184 --> 23:16.144
in my twisted imagination

23:16.228 --> 23:18.647
cause realitYhurts

23:18.730 --> 23:23.485
I think I'd rather stay here
